Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Driving in Rainy Night Condition" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 ;
    :hasActor :actor1 ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 .

:weather1 a :RainyCondition .

:actor1 a :Vehicle ;  # Assuming the yellow vehicle is the main focus
    :description "Yellow taxi cab driving on the road" .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Potential road surface obstruction due to rain" .

:risk1 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Risk of rear-end collision due to slippery road conditions" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class
